{
  "bodyHash": "KT+1VrA0LuA=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/104/weapon-gif.gif\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">本模组需要安装<a style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquarius Libs</a>和<a style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pisces-libs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pisces Libs</a>才能正常工作！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">「日本武器」模组新增了9种日本历史上曾用于战斗的武器类型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">这些物品可使用木材、石材、铜、铁、金、钻石制作，并可升级为下界合金武器。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>镰刀（Kama）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">一种可能是从农具演变而来的镰状武器。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">比普通剑稍快但攻击力较弱，同时可作为锄头使用。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/106/kama.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>苦无（Kunai）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>一种多用途工具，最初被认为源自泥瓦匠的抹刀。后来被忍者修行者采用，成为一种多功能、易于隐藏的多用途工具。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻击速度极快但伤害低，可投掷，能附上三叉戟、剑和锹的附魔，同时也可用作锹。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/107/kunai.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>长卷（Nagamaki）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>一种传统日本刀剑，拥有微弯的刀身和超长握柄，曾被日本封建时期的武士阶级使用。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">比普通剑更强但更慢，同时提供额外的攻击范围加成（+1）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/108/nagamaki.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>薙刀（Naginata）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>一种长柄武器，同样被日本封建时期的武士、足轻（步兵）和僧兵使用。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>也是女武者（onna-musha）的标志性武器，属于日本贵族阶层的女性战士。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">因其尺寸获得额外攻击范围加成（+2）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/109/naginata.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>野太刀（Nodachi）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>一种特化远程作战的战场武器，带有微弯的刀身，同样被日本封建时期的武士使用。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻击力极高但速度慢，并获得攻击范围加成（+1.5）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/110/nodachi.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>冲绳拐（Okinawan Tonfa）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>一种近战武器，源自冲绳武术中的武装部分，在当地被称为「<strong>tunkua</strong>」。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻击力弱但速度快，可作为盾牌使用（格挡值40%-80%）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/111/tonfa.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>刺股（Sasumata）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>一种「捕人叉」长柄武器，被日本封建时期的武士及其随从使用。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻击力弱且速度慢，但获得攻击范围加成（+1）和击退加成（+2）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/114/sasumata.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>手里剑（Shuriken）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>被武士和忍者用作一次性辅助武器，用于分散注意力、误导或在游击战中骚扰敌人。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">可堆叠，伤害低，速度极快，可投掷。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/113/shuriken.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>铁钩爪（Tekko-Kagi）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em>一种传统日本爪形手持武器和工具，历史上被忍者和武术家使用。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">攻击力弱但速度快，可作为盾牌使用（格挡值30%-65%）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1680/112/tekkokagi.gif\" width=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（武器描述取自维基百科等来源，仅作简要介绍）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">本模组的主要目标是增加武器种类，而非添加过于强大的物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">当前支持<strong>Forge、Fabric和NeoForge版本1.21.9 - 1.21.11、26.x。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">低于1.21.9的版本不受支持。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
